      <rules>
        <rule name="Inscribe Runes" id="1311-94e9-c2ce-3fbf" hidden="false">
          <description>A Runesmith knows one minor rune (see list at the end of this warband list), determined randomly when the warband is first created.
He may inscribe the rune on an item carried by one of the warriors of his warband, and (if successful) the item will gain a bonus from the rune for that game.


When a Runesmith advances and rolls a skill on the Hero Advance table, he may choose to learn a new rune instead of learning a skill (exactly like a spellcaster advancing and learning a new spell).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
